@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam defaultFontColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #4b5563
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #4b5563
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #4b5563
skinparam actorBorderColor #4b5563
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #e5e7eb
skinparam noteBorderColor #4b5563
skinparam nodesep 14
skinparam ranksep 30

title Market Desk | local shopper goals through J08
actor Shopper as shopper
actor "Consumer Council\nprice feed" as feed
rectangle "Local Market Desk - one user, H2 file" as App {
  usecase "Find and compare\naccepted products / offer text" as search
  usecase "Manage My list\n(quantity, retailer, checked state)" as list
  usecase "Review planned budget\nand category estimates" as budget
  usecase "Save / remove\nwishlist products" as wishlist
  usecase "Track one or all retailers\nfor an exact product" as track
  usecase "Manage target / drop alerts,\ntiming, read state and snooze" as alerts
  usecase "Manage interval reminders;\nclear, snooze or add to My list" as reminder
  usecase "Load checked sample" as sample
  usecase "Refresh live prices" as refresh
}
shopper -- search
shopper -- list
shopper -- budget
shopper -- wishlist
shopper -- track
shopper -- alerts
shopper -- reminder
shopper -- sample
shopper -- refresh
refresh -- feed
note right of App
  **Reading this view**
  Saving, tracking, and adding to My list
  are separate actions.

  History records changes after accepted
  LIVE imports. The sample is excluded.

  Alerts and reminders are in-app.
  A closed app collects and delivers nothing.

  Budgets describe a shopping plan,
  not purchases or actual spending.

  Offer text is preserved; promotional
  discounts are not calculated.

  The feed is a supporting actor on the right.
  Only the shopper starts a refresh.
end note
@enduml
